<p>Increases your movement speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.06%, 0.17%, 0.25%, 0.32%, 0.38%</acronym> per percent of positive energy and your casting speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.06%, 0.17%, 0.25%, 0.32%, 0.38%</acronym> per percent of negative energy, up to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5.00%, 13%, 20%, 25%, 30%</acronym> at 80%. Sustained energy still counts toward the maximum.</p>